   "description": "Draft an outbound onboarding email for the customer based on the audit results.\n\nComposition Rules:\n1. If Status is READY:\n   - Draft a warm, personalized welcome email addressed to the customer.\n   - Reference their specific company, role, and use case.\n   - Provide relevant, tailored next steps (e.g. documentation, kickoff call, setup guide).\n2. If Status is INCOMPLETE:\n   - Draft a polite, helpful email thanking them for signing up.\n   - Clearly ask for the specific missing or vague information needed to complete onboarding.\n   - Keep the tone encouraging, professional, and supportive.\n\nOutput ONLY the complete email (Subject line and Body) — no meta explanations or markdown tags.",
   "output": "Subject: Welcome to Cyberdyne Systems - Let's Get Started with Threat Intelligence Automation!\n\nDear Sarah,\n\nWe're thrilled to welcome you and Cyberdyne Systems to our community of threat intelligence leaders! As Chief Security Officer, you're taking a crucial step in automating threat intelligence aggregation and incident response, and we're excited to support you on this journey.\n\nBased on your company's specific needs, we've tailored a customized onboarding experience to ensure a seamless integration of our solution. Our team will guide you through the setup process, providing you with the necessary documentation and support to get started.\n\nTo begin, we recommend reviewing our comprehensive setup guide, which can be found in your dedicated onboarding portal. This resource will walk you through the key features and functionalities of our solution, ensuring you're well-prepared for our scheduled kickoff call.\n\nDuring our kickoff call, we'll discuss your specific use case, address any questions you may have, and provide a detailed overview of our solution's capabilities. This call will also serve as an opportunity for you to share your team's experiences and challenges, allowing us to better understand your needs and provide targeted support.\n\nIf you have any questions or concerns before our kickoff call, please don't hesitate to reach out to us. We're committed to ensuring your onboarding experience is smooth and successful.\n\nThank you for choosing our solution, and we look forward to working closely with you and the Cyberdyne Systems team.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name]\nCustomer Success Manager\n[Your Company]",
